{"level":30,"time":1778273666526,"pid":56878,"hostname":"Mac.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01NzidudbfPGswNXEy6fdfji","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is important! The vision check found trees very close to overhead electric lines - some as close as 0.1 feet (essentially on the line) and 1.4 to 3.2 feet. These are marked with \"M\" symbols on the landscape plan.\n\nFrom the plant schedule, the \"M\" designation is for \"Mitigation Trees\" - these are likely the trees being planted as part of the mitigation requirement.\n\nHowever, I see the trees are labeled \"M\" - not specifically identified as to species. I need to determine:\n1. What species are these trees?\n2. Are they utility-compatible?\n3. What are their mature heights?\n\nThe measurement I got shows several mitigation trees are within close proximity to the overhead electric line. The grouping guide specifies:\n- Non-utility-compatible trees must be > 15 feet from distribution conductors\n- Utility-compatible trees are allowed < 15 feet\n- Large trees (40+ feet) must be > 25 feet from distribution conductors\n\nLet me check the landscape plan blocks to identify the species of the \"M\" mitigation trees and their locations more precisely.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1716,"cache_read_input_tokens":52191,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1716},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e1eed96-d749-4c9f-b941-3ae8c1ee87e2","uuid":"d56ed045-c631-4f4f-9784-5f92947d1250"}
{"level":30,"time":1778273668351,"pid":56878,"hostname":"Mac.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01NzidudbfPGswNXEy6fdfji","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Uq1iwxZ6R97Qc6kRcAk6nE","name":"mcp__conductor_tools__vision_check","input":{"checklistItemId":"el-md-exp:EL-2.10","checklistItemText":"Plant legend or plant schedule does not identify species of trees proposed near electric facilities","question":"On the landscape plan (Sheet 31), are the mitigation trees (marked with \"M\" symbols) near the overhead electric line on the south property line identified by species? If not listed on Sheet 31, is there a legend or note on Sheet 31 referring to another sheet (such as Sheet 35) for the species identification of the \"M\" mitigation trees?","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":31},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1716,"cache_read_input_tokens":52191,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1716},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e1eed96-d749-4c9f-b941-3ae8c1ee87e2","uuid":"ca1f048e-f0a3-4f8e-b81b-f78bf380ef7d"}
