ghout the site plan.\n\n**What are their locations relative to buildings?**\nI can identify five \"Electrical Transformer Pad\" locations:\n1.  West of **Bldg. 1** (near Unit 101/102), positioned between the building and the curved driveway/road.\n2.  West of **Bldg. 2** (near Unit 201/202), positioned between the building and the adjacent retaining wall/easement.\n3.  West of **Bldg. 8** (near Unit 801/802), positioned near the sidewalk easement.\n4.  East of **Bldg. 4** (near Unit 404) and **Bldg. 5** (near Unit 504), positioned between the buildings and the eastern property line.\n5.  East of **Bldg. 7** (near Unit 704) and **Bldg. 6** (near Unit 604), positioned between the buildings and the eastern property line.\n\n**What are their dimensions?**\nThere are **no dimensions** labeled on or immediately adjacent to any of the \"Electrical Transformer Pad\" boxes.\n\n**Are clearances to buildings and open areas labeled?**\nNo, there are **no clearance distances labeled** indicating the required space between the transformer pads and the adjacent buildings or open areas."}]}
