at 0 feet)\n   - Tree species need to be verified against ECM Appendix F utility compatible list\n\n4. **MISSING DOCUMENTATION:**\n   - No building elevation sheets showing vertical clearances to overhead lines\n   - No profile/section sheets showing clearance dimensions from overhead conductors\n   - No horizontal clearance dimensions from outer conductor to building faces on site plan\n   - No registered surveyor data for pole locations or mid-span clearances\n   - Unclear if a 48-hour notification note is included on the general notes sheet\n   - No specific documentation about whether lines are distribution or transmission (no voltage information)\n\nI should check for any profile or section sheets that might show clearances, construction details referencing overhead lines, and verify the 48-hour notification requirement is documented.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2690,"cache_read_input_tokens":60798,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2690},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad5307f2-d9b7-488b-8d54-395eaf0212d6","uuid":"82431c13-0829-4047-b7b0-8d9af5f5b4c7"}
