{"level":30,"time":1778274506668,"pid":56878,"hostname":"Mac.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":5,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01QA2cPgGbuZ414VZWUULyrz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Let me continue gathering information on the other checklist items. So far I have:\n\nEL-13.1 - Transformer pads lack min 5-foot clearance from buildings - APPEARS TO PASS (all > 5 feet)\nEL-13.2 - Transformer pads lack min 5-foot clearance from retaining walls - APPEARS TO PASS (no adjacent retaining walls, ~20-30 feet away)\nEL-13.3 - Transformer pads lack required clearance from fences - N/A (no fences shown)\nEL-13.10 - Hot-stick use area lacks min 10-foot clearance - NEED MORE INFO (measurements show 19-72 feet to buildings, which passes, but need to verify access door orientation and confirm all sides)\n\nNow I need to check:\n- Fire hydrants (Sheet 10)\n- Fire lanes (Sheet 10)\n- Dumpsters, bike racks, light poles (Sheet 9)\n- Trees near transformers (Sheets 31-37)\n- Underground utilities (Sheets 11-28)\n- Overhead lines (Sheet 21)\n- Property boundaries and easements\n- Parking areas (for bollards requirement EL-13.38)\n\nLet me check the fire protection plan and other sheets.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2874,"cache_read_input_tokens":53100,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2874},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"50ce05b6-fbb2-48af-b483-350129d29c8d","uuid":"378515be-1af0-40d0-8648-d1d8465a7569"}
