alled out.\n*   **Distribution vs. Transmission:** The OHE lines are **not** identified as either \"distribution\" or \"transmission\" anywhere on the sheet.\n\nA full review of the text blocks, including the \"Utility Notes\" in the bottom right corner, reveals no mention of electrical line voltage or classification. The annotations pointing to the specific electrical infrastructure (highlighted in blue) only use exact labels such as:\n*   \"Electrical Pull Box\"\n*   \"Electrical Transformer Pad\"\n*   \"Electrical Meters\"\n*   \"Underground Electric Line\""}]}
