{"level":30,"time":1778275958136,"pid":56878,"hostname":"Mac.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":5,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01EgbECKobAhy7iDUnw9jg2p","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good data so far. Let me summarize what I have on wastewater, storm drain, and clarify on trees:\n\nEL-13.22 (Wastewater clearance):\n- Transformer Pad near Bldg 1: 51.2 feet to WW (PASS)\n- Transformer Pad near Bldg 2: 35.8 feet to WW (PASS)\n- Transformer Pad near Bldg 8: 136.5 feet to WW (PASS)\n- Transformer Pad east of Bldg 4: 15.9 feet to WW (PASS)\n- Transformer Pad east of Bldg 7: 30.5 feet to WW (PASS)\nAll pass - minimum 5-foot requirement.\n\nEL-13.23 (Storm drain clearance):\n- Transformer Pad near Bldg 1: 76.7 feet to SD (PASS)\n- Transformer Pad near Bldg 2: 51.1 feet to SD (PASS)\n- Transformer Pad near Bldg 8: 19.2 feet to SD (PASS)\n- Transformer Pad east of Bldg 4: 33.6 feet to SD (PASS)\n- Transformer Pad east of Bldg 7: 16.2 feet to SD (PASS)\nAll pass - minimum 5-foot requirement.\n\nEL-13.13 (Trees): The landscape plan vision check didn't show transformer pads. I need to check this against the existing tree plan. The issue is whether there are trees within 10 lateral feet of transformer pads. Let me try checking the existing tree plan (Sheet 30) and also overlaying with the site plan.\n\nLet me continue checking the remaining items - parking/bollards, property boundaries, grading/drainage direction for oil-filled equipment, easements, and cross-sections.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3488,"cache_read_input_tokens":69505,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3488},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_