s the analysis regarding your questions:\n\n*   **Are transformers, pull boxes, or other underground electric equipment labeled?**\n    I do not have access to the electrical plan (Sheet 21) to compare. On the provided Landscape Plan (Sheet 28), there are **no explicit labels** for transformers, pull boxes, or underground electric (\"UE\") equipment. The legend (Key Notes) does not contain symbols for electrical equipment. There is an overhead electric line labeled \"**OHE**\" running along the bottom (South) property line.\n\n*   **Can the locations be cross-referenced between sheets to determine 5 lateral feet clearance?**\n    Because the underground electrical equipment is not specifically drawn or labeled on this Landscape Plan, you cannot use this sheet alone to verify the 5-foot lateral clearance. You would need to overlay this landscape plan with the electrical plan to determine if any proposed trees conflict with the underground utilities. \n\n*   **Are there trees shown in proximity to the marked locations of these utilities?**\n    Since underground electric utilities are not marked on this sheet, I cannot confirm proximity to them. However, there are multiple proposed trees shown directly adjacent to and potentially underneath the marked Overhead Electric (\"**OHE**\") line along the bottom edge of the site plan."}]}
