s Around Pads:** There are **no** rectangular or bounded areas explicitly labeled as \"transformer easement\" or \"electrical easement\" drawn around these pads, nor are there easement boundaries marked with dimensions specifically enclosing these pads. \n*   **Closest Related Feature:** For four of the five \"Electrical Transformer Pad\" locations, there are no bounding boxes of any kind drawn around them. However, for the pad located on the middle-left side of the plan (west of Building 8, near Unit 801), there is a dashed rectangular boundary drawn around/adjacent to the pad equipment. The leader line pointing to this dashed boundary labels it as a **\"Vault Easement\"**. \n\nIn summary, while the pads themselves are clearly labeled, specific bounded areas labeled as transformer or electrical easements with dimensions surrounding them are not shown on this plan."}]}
