ge, water, or sewer easements, the transformer pad located west of Building 8 is situated entirely within a designated **\"Vault Easement\"**."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2cfb3d30-a54c-43db-bd21-983850252c35","uuid":"a463c5ef-c77b-40a2-9ae0-278517363c32","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a careful visual review of the provided electrical site plan, here are the findings regarding the \"Electrical Transformer Pad\" locations and their proximity to marked easements:\n\nI can identify five locations on the plan explicitly labeled with a callout pointing to an **\"Electrical Transformer Pad\"**:\n1.  West of Building 1 (near Unit 101)\n2.  West of Building 2 (near Unit 201)\n3.  West of Building 8 (near Unit 801/802)\n4.  East of Building 4 (near Unit 404)\n5.  East of Building 7 (near Unit 703/704)\n\n**Analysis of overlaps with easements:**\n\n*   **Drainage, Water, and Sewer Easements:** None of the transformer pads appear to be located within the boundaries of the explicitly labeled drainage, water, or wastewater easements shown on this plan. For example, the pads east of Buildings 4 and 7 are located west of the boundary line for the **\"25' Drainage Easement\"** and **\"15' Water/Wastewater Easement\"** on the eastern edge of the property. The pad west of Building 1 is located south of the marked **\"Wastewater Easement\"** area.\n*   **Electrical/Vault Easements:** There is one instance where a transformer pad is located within a marked easement bounding box.\n    *   Located on the middle-left side of the drawing, west of Building 8 (near Units 801 and 802), there is an **\"Electrical Transformer Pad\"** and an adjacent **\"Electrical Pull Box\"**.\n    *   Both of these components are enclosed within a dashed rectangular boundary.\n    *   A callout explicitly labeled **\"Vault Easement\"** has a leader line pointing directly to this dashed rectangular boundary enclosing the transformer pad.\n\nIn summary, while no pads are shown overlapping standard drainage, water, or sewer easements, the transformer pad located west of Building 8 is situated entirely within a designated **\"Vault Easement\"**."}]}
