rub clearances (no landscape plan details provided)\n9. EL-13.15 - Root barriers for trees (landscape coordination missing)\n10. EL-13.17 - Bike rack clearance (site plan coordination needed)\n11. EL-13.18 - Light pole clearance (transformer locations not indicated)\n12. EL-13.20 - Inter-pad clearances (no distance dimensions shown)\n13. EL-13.21 - Water line clearance (utility plan lacks transformer placement)\n14. EL-13.22 - Wastewater clearance (utility coordination incomplete)\n15. EL-13.23 - Storm drain clearance (drainage plan missing transformer details)\n16. EL-13.25 - Other utility clearances (utility plan coordination gaps)\n17. EL-13.26 - Vertical utility separation (no cross-sections; no plan coordination)\n18. EL-13.27 - Overhead line clearance (overhead lines not fully detailed)\n19. EL-13.28 - Overhead conductor radial clearance (overhead lines not shown)\n20. EL-13.29 - Niche vertical clearance (no cross-sections provided)\n21. EL-13.31 - Cross-sections for overhead structures (not provided)\n22. EL-13.32 - Drainage direction for oil-filled equipment (no grading overlay; equipment type not specified)\n23. EL-13.36 - Electrical routing private property verification (routing shown but property boundaries not called out for each segment)\n\nThe overall assessment identifies 8 failures, 3 passes, 5 items marked as not applicable, and 23 findings that cannot be verified from the submitted documents.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10866,"cache_read_input_tokens":75672,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10866},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2cfb3d30-a54c-43db-bd21-983850252c35","uuid":"fc370905-1b6b-4492-b6a9-37b9de210465"}
